{"sha": "c660e82269fee69039587bdc41ae8875ce42814c0c77a273e97c72a01fc6a9e3", "body": ["\\begin{remark}[这一规则的来源]\\label{rem:g10:lewis-and-shape:vsepr}", "这一规则只是一个模型，但对小分子的效果出奇地好；", "它在本科一年级分册中得到了更精确的表述，并得到了部分解释。孤电子对", "所占的空间比成键电子对略大，因此氨中的键角", "（\\ang{106.7}）和水中的键角（\\ang{104.5}）都比甲烷的", "\\ang{109.5} 略小。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  % methane, tetrahedral, in perspective", "  \\begin{scope}", "    \\node[aC] (c) at (0,0) {};", "    \\node[aH, minimum size=3.6mm] (hb) at (0.3,-0.12) {};", "    \\node[aH] (h1) at (0,1.05) {};", "    \\node[aH] (h2) at (-1.0,-0.45) {};", "    \\node[aH] (h3) at (0.72,-0.5) {};", "    \\begin{scope}[on background layer]", "      \\foreach \\h in {h1,h2,h3,hb} \\draw[bond] (c.center) -- (\\h.center);", "    \\end{scope}", "    \\node[aC] at (0,0) {};", "    \\node at (0,-1.35) {甲烷：四面体形};", "    \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (-0.55,0.55) {\\ang{109.5}};", "  \\end{scope}", "  % ammonia, pyramid", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=4.2cm]", "    \\fill[omDef!25] (0,0.2) ellipse (0.18 and 0.45);", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omDef] at (0,1.0) {孤电子对};", "    \\node[aN] (n) at (0,0) {};", "    \\node[aH] (h1) at (-0.95,-0.5) {};", "    \\node[aH] (h2) at (0.7,-0.55) {};", "    \\node[aH, minimum size=3.6mm] (h3) at (0.25,-0.2) {};", "    \\begin{scope}[on background layer]", "      \\foreach \\h in {h1,h2,h3} \\draw[bond] (n.center) -- (\\h.center);", "    \\end{scope}", "    \\node[aN] at (0,0) {};", "    \\node at (0,-1.35) {氨：三角锥形};", "  \\end{scope}", "  % water, bent", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=8.4cm]", "    \\fill[omDef!25, rotate=25] (0,0.2) ellipse (0.16 and 0.42);", "    \\fill[omDef!25, rotate=-25] (0,0.2) ellipse (0.16 and 0.42);", "    \\node[aO] (o) at (0,0) {};", "    \\node[aH] (h1) at (-0.8,-0.58) {};", "    \\node[aH] (h2) at (0.8,-0.58) {};", "    \\begin{scope}[on background layer]", "      \\draw[bond] (o.center) -- (h1.center); \\draw[bond] (o.center) -- (h2.center);", "    \\end{scope}", "    \\node[aO] at (0,0) {};", "    \\draw[black!60] (-0.32,-0.23) arc[start angle=216, end angle=324, radius=0.4];", "    \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (0,-0.65) {\\ang{104.5}};", "    \\node at (0,-1.35) {水：V 形};", "  \\end{scope}", "  % carbon dioxide, linear", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=12.0cm]", "    \\node[aO] (a) at (-0.8,0) {}; \\node[aC] (c) at (0,0) {}; \\node[aO] (b) at (0.8,0) {};", "    \\begin{scope}[on background layer]", "      \\foreach \\d in {-1.6,1.6} {", "        \\draw[bond, line width=1.1pt] ([yshift=\\d pt]a.center) -- ([yshift=\\d pt]c.center);", "        \\draw[bond, line width=1.1pt] ([yshift=\\d pt]c.center) -- ([yshift=\\d pt]b.center);}", "    \\end{scope}", "    \\node at (0,-1.35) {二氧化碳：直线形};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 四种分子的形状（阴影瓣表示孤电子对）。", "% ledger: ang:H2O, ang:NH3", "甲烷为四面体，氨为三角锥形，水为 V 形，二氧化碳", "为直线形。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\includegraphics[width=0.38\\linewidth]{images/book1/ai/g10-balloons-tetrahedron.jpg}", "", "{\\small 四个绑在一起的气球互相推挤，尽可能远离彼此；", "在空间中它们指向四面体的顶点，", "与碳原子周围的四个电子对类似。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{在空间中画分子}", "", "\\begin{notation}[楔形键与虚线键]\\label{not:g10:lewis-and-shape:wedge}", "要在平面纸上画出空间中的分子，位于纸面内的键", "画成普通线条，指向读者的键画成实心楔形，", "背离读者的键画成虚线楔形。甲烷的画法如下：", "两个键位于纸面内，一个指向读者，一个背离读者。", "\\begin{center}", "\\chemfig{C(-[2]H)(-[4]H)(<[7]H)(<:[5]H)}", "\\end{center}", "\\end{notation}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g10:lewis-and-shape:1}", "什么是共价键？什么是孤电子对？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g10:lewis-and-shape:2}", "氢、碳、氮和氧通常各能形成几个共价键？", "请用八隅规则和二隅规则加以说明。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g10:lewis-and-shape:3}", "画出氯化氢 \\ce{HCl} 的路易斯结构，并数一数", "氯原子周围的电子数。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g10:lewis-and-shape:4}", "\\ce{NH3} 分子一共有多少个价电子？", "共有多少个电子对？", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}